      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>If a trashless deck needs to be shuffled, I tend to only shuffle it if any of the cards in the deck are known, eg if someone like the Visionary or the Adept has determined which card is on the top/bottom and therefore you do know at least one specific card.</p>",
