      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-10T14:54:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What's interesting though is that Summon Staff was changed so that <a href=\"https://trello.com/c/xXxG4IDt/27-if-summon-staff-does-not-find-a-staff-of-ra-the-deck-is-not-shuffled\">if there are no Staves in the deck, the deck isn't shuffled.</a> Not sure if this would be related. Especailly since I don't think this would work in the physical game. You search your deck and don't find a Staff so you suddently get to see the entire deck? Probably not. If you know there aren't any Staves in the deck, can you choose not to shuffle or do you still have to \"search and shuffle\".</p>",
