      "raw": "<p>What&#39;s interesting though is that Summon Staff was changed so that <a href=\"https://trello.com/c/xXxG4IDt/27-if-summon-staff-does-not-find-a-staff-of-ra-the-deck-is-not-shuffled\">if there are no Staves in the deck, the deck isn&#39;t shuffled.</a> Not sure if this would be related. Especailly since I don&#39;t think this would work in the physical game. You search your deck and don&#39;t find a Staff so you suddently get to see the entire deck? Probably not. If you know there aren&#39;t any Staves in the deck, can you choose not to shuffle or do you still have to &quot;search and shuffle&quot;.</p>",
