      "raw": "[quote=\"Pydro\"]\n\nWhat&#39;s interesting though is that Summon Staff was changed so that <a href=\"https://trello.com/c/xXxG4IDt/27-if-summon-staff-does-not-find-a-staff-of-ra-the-deck-is-not-shuffled\" rel=\"nofollow\">if there are no Staves in the deck, the deck isn&#39;t shuffled.</a>\n\n[/quote]\n\n&quot;If there are no Staves in the deck, the deck isn&#39;t shuffled&quot; was the bug that was fixed in version 1.4.1. Now, the deck is always shuffled.\n\nWe discussed with Christopher, and &quot;shuffle the trash into the deck&quot; should cause a shuffle even when the trash is empty. This will be fixed in an update.\n\nNote: on the tabletop, if you don&#39;t know anything about the state of the deck, it makes no difference whether you shuffle in that case from an information POV.\n",
